flowchart LR
accTitle: Evidence states from memory retrieval to workspace admission
accDescr: M2 retrieves eligible CoALA memories. B1 selects memory candidates and may project long-term references into working memory. The application separately prepares typed workspace candidates for B3. B3 admits a bounded snapshot that is broadcast to designated consumers. A later verified outcome is separate from selection, admission, and receipt.
    M2[M2 cross-store retrieval] --> MC[Retrieved memory candidates]
    MC --> B1[B1 memory selection]
    B1 --> SEL[Selected memory candidates]
    SEL --> PROJ[Optional long-term reference projection]
    PROJ --> WM[CoALA working memory]
    APP[Domain and application adapter] --> CANDS[Separate typed workspace candidates]
    SEL -. explicit optional attribution .-> CANDS
    CANDS --> B3[B3 bounded workspace admission]
    B3 --> SNAP[Cycle-scoped workspace snapshot]
    SNAP --> BC[Broadcast to designated consumers]
    BC --> REC[Consumer receipts]
    REC --> OUT[Separately verified outcome]
